{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-13-14","kind":"proposition","title":"作内接于球的正八面体","englishTitle":"To construct an octahedron and comprehend it in a sphere, as in the preceding case; and to prove that the square on the diameter of the sphere is double of the square on the side of the octahedron.","book":13,"number":14,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.14","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.14/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":14,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-13-14@raw-cfb83d5dcc671102","contentId":"euclid-13-14","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cfb83d5dcc671102b9754ed312b47d67b680c340551d066c4b630c524b73ddee","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-13-14.statement","euclid-13-14.construction.1","euclid-13-14.proof.1","euclid-13-14.proof.2","euclid-13-14.proof.3","euclid-13-14.proof.4","euclid-13-14.proof.5","euclid-13-14.proof.6","euclid-13-14.proof.7","euclid-13-14.proof.8","euclid-13-14.proof.9","euclid-13-14.proof.10","euclid-13-14.proof.11","euclid-13-14.proof.12","euclid-13-14.proof.13","euclid-13-14.proof.14","euclid-13-14.proof.15","euclid-13-14.proof.16","euclid-13-14.proof.17","euclid-13-14.conclusion","euclid-13-14.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-13-14.statement","contentId":"euclid-13-14","revisionId":"euclid-13-14@raw-cfb83d5dcc671102","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"571e19414de0a39ef090fe90e9dc9302c8afd05a871386addde119b78b152f1d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To construct an octahedron and comprehend it in a sphere, as in the preceding case; and to prove that the square on the diameter of the sphere is double of the square on the side of the octahedron."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"制造八面体,并像前一情况那样,在球体中理解八面体;并证明球体直径为正方形,是八面体侧正方形的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-14.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-13-14","revisionId":"euclid-13-14@raw-cfb83d5dcc671102","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c5f85dcf1b218dd8bdcf2f0444a15e006461594677b0b1e558fcf8e7367b881c","citations":["euclid-11-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the diameter AB of the given sphere be set out, and let it be bisected at C; let the semicircle ADB be described on AB, let CD be drawn from C at right angles to AB, let DB be joined; let the square EFGH, having each of its sides equal to DB, be set out, let HF, EG be joined, from the point K let the straight line KL be set up at right angles to the plane of the square EFGH [[XI. 12](/principles/euclid-11-12)], and let it be carried through to the other side of the plane, as KM; from the straight lines KL, KM let KL, KM be respectively cut off equal to one of the straight lines EK, FK, GK, HK, and let LE, LF, LG, LH, ME, MF, MG, MH be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将特定球体的直径AB确定为C,将两切;将ADB半圆圈描述为AB,将CD从直角时的C射至AB,将DB相连接;将正方形 EFGH,其两侧等于DB,将HF EG连接起来,将K直线KL线设于正方形 EFGH线中的直角至平面,将其直线直通平面,将其划至平面线的另一方,成为KM;将EK、FK、GK、HK和HK直线中的一条分别切断KL、KM直线,ME、KM直线中的相应一条连接LE、LF、LG、LH、ME、MF、MG、MH。 [[XI. 12](/principles/euclid-11-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-14.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-13-14","revisionId":"euclid-13-14@raw-cfb83d5dcc671102","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3139a57c815af39b0064a24c8c1d707abd41d8bfbe535cf1f463c4054068f8d0","citations":["euclid-1-47"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since KE is equal to KH, and the angle EKH is right, therefore the square on HE is double of the square on EK. [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"KE等于KH,EKH该角是直角,因此HE的正方形是EK的正方形的两倍。 [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-14.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-13-14","revisionId":"euclid-13-14@raw-cfb83d5dcc671102","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d804dcb02e543e8477d2505ddbf0d0919dcacf88c81ec7fa58672ff459d6fc87","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since LK is equal to KE, and the angle LKE is right, therefore the square on EL is double of the square on EK. [id.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于LK等于KE,角度LKE是正确的,因此EL的正方形是EK的正方形的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-14.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-13-14","revisionId":"euclid-13-14@raw-cfb83d5dcc671102","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eec72392416a55357f9580b6ac049c8376bd757f5c5132caf3fd34bb5830d012","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on HE was also proved double of the square on EK; therefore the square on LE is equal to the square on EH; therefore LE is equal to EH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但HE的正方形和EK的正方形也证明是原来的两倍;因此,LE的正方形和EH的正方形等于正方形;因此,LE等于EH。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-14.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-13-14","revisionId":"euclid-13-14@raw-cfb83d5dcc671102","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"89c2ba6a0e57d29ddb1dc693c840b87285490aceb48c087509130e9c2eb47a45","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason LH is also equal to HE; therefore the triangle LEH is equilateral."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,LH也等于HE;因此三角形LEH是等边形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-14.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-13-14","revisionId":"euclid-13-14@raw-cfb83d5dcc671102","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b7f18b9eb941a3eb408d227fbc1d997f1ae73ff81adb6b5a091a30b3dea6f8e0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that each of the remaining triangles of which the sides of the square EFGH are the bases, and the points L, M the vertices, is equilateral; therefore an octahedron has been constructed which is contained by eight equilateral triangles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,正方形 EFGH三角形的两侧为底边,而顶端为L M,每个三角形都是等边的;因此,已经建造了八面形,由8 等边三角形组成。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-14.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-13-14","revisionId":"euclid-13-14@raw-cfb83d5dcc671102","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2122a84e75a7b89c990587842400c1f8fdaa5c4096a35d2685b4b1c098b3ad08","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is next required to comprehend it in the given sphere, and to prove that the square on the diameter of the sphere is double of the square on the side of the octahedron."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"下一步需要将它理解为特定球体,并证明球体直径的正方形是八面体侧的正方形的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-14.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-13-14","revisionId":"euclid-13-14@raw-cfb83d5dcc671102","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7847e42d7f9e2a37bb7a4c5ef595f6ba76bd86c92d2206978287359199912c06","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since the three straight lines LK, KM, KE are equal to one another, therefore the semicircle described on LM will also pass through E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,由于三条直线LK,KM,KE是等同的,因此,LM中描述的半圆形也将通过E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-14.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-13-14","revisionId":"euclid-13-14@raw-cfb83d5dcc671102","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"39d75213b7e6733c44eacefde552dfc5790bf8b3af6d86b9400f851c9a2b33f1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And for the same reason, if, LM remaining fixed, the semicircle be carried round and restored to the same position from which it began to be moved, it will also pass through the points F, G, H, and the octahedron will have been comprehended in a sphere."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,如果LM未修好的半圆圈被绕过,并恢复到开始移动的同一位置,它也将通过F、G、H点,八面体将被一个球体所理解。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-14.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-13-14","revisionId":"euclid-13-14@raw-cfb83d5dcc671102","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"48129c2fdbd648738aa04af8ef7c560d83ca3db1d9f3df0d0ff9a046400bc19a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also comprehended in the given sphere."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来我说,它也体现在特定领域。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-14.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-13-14","revisionId":"euclid-13-14@raw-cfb83d5dcc671102","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d544fc00673bb87cfe0042101cb4433830f0a19295ea1349df82ee3419740ecb","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since LK is equal to KM, while KE is common, and they contain right angles, therefore the base LE is equal to the base EM. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为LK等于KM,而KE是普通的,含有直角,因此底边 LE等于底边 EM。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-14.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-13-14","revisionId":"euclid-13-14@raw-cfb83d5dcc671102","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7baef6a1b644762f8a1fd1cf3e1f35cf2f9899bd93bb8667ef5a16cef6b3aa10","citations":["euclid-3-31","euclid-1-47"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the angle LEM is right, for it is in a semicircle, [[III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31)] therefore the square on LM is double of the square on LE. [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"LEM的该角是直角,因为它处于半圆形, 因此LM的正方形是LE的正方形的两倍。 [[III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31)] [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-14.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-13-14","revisionId":"euclid-13-14@raw-cfb83d5dcc671102","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"58c74aac179a82a0e40e69746ee006bc085eb981dac71accfc40658db39e6951","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since AC is equal to CB, AB is double of BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,AC等于CB,AB等于BC的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-14.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-13-14","revisionId":"euclid-13-14@raw-cfb83d5dcc671102","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e9a566e702ffb36fb94e20a7fac7150892e502ec6f94500b1c8a0bc43ed06932","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as AB is to BC, so is the square on AB to the square on BD; therefore the square on AB is double of the square on BD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AB对BC的比等于AB对正方形的比,BD对正方形的比;因此,AB对AB的比是BD对正方形的比的两倍"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-14.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-13-14","revisionId":"euclid-13-14@raw-cfb83d5dcc671102","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7d246723bbf9dd1138cb5fb31aca5c791c64f6e539ac88f0f730517760f6ad14","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on LM was also proved double of the square on LE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但LM正方形也证明是LE正方形的两倍"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-14.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-13-14","revisionId":"euclid-13-14@raw-cfb83d5dcc671102","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"568e029d9bf83764bc6e0f4139bd0580537baecd9363880d04394109a75f0d2a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the square on DB is equal to the square on LE, for EH was made equal to DB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DB的正方形等于LE的正方形,EH等于DB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-14.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-13-14","revisionId":"euclid-13-14@raw-cfb83d5dcc671102","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"65da6a9e96099f2a055c7aa41406eeea58ff8c60ec24f4a56137cdfb8df9c033","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the square on AB is also equal to the square on LM; therefore AB is equal to LM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB比正方形等于LM等于正方形,AB等于LM。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-14.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-13-14","revisionId":"euclid-13-14@raw-cfb83d5dcc671102","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5ccaa3b323d58a23f12345786f37fb0b4f06309af08110bc15d13413817f7921","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And AB is the diameter of the given sphere; therefore LM is equal to the diameter of the given sphere."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是给定球体的直径, 因此, LM 等于给定球体的直径 。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-14.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-13-14","revisionId":"euclid-13-14@raw-cfb83d5dcc671102","order":19,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3b53e1df61620b1ea36035288b1b8e67cb44ac3ccc54b538dc418398ee65651b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the octahedron has been comprehended in the given sphere, and it has been demonstrated at the same time that the square on the diameter of the sphere is double of the square on the side of the octahedron. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,八面体已被特定领域所理解,同时,也证明球的直径为正方形,是八面体侧的正方形的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-14.source","contentId":"euclid-13-14","revisionId":"euclid-13-14@raw-cfb83d5dcc671102","order":20,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"69c6153c42b4705a9dedbeae4271adf6807d6b2a3fb03deeed2c3b1a487e6f6c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.14/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.14\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-13-14:euclid-11-12:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-14.construction.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-12","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.14","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.14/","sourceLabel":"XI. 12"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-13-14:euclid-1-47:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-14.proof.1","euclid-13-14.proof.11"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-47","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.14","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.14/","sourceLabel":"I. 47"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-13-14:euclid-1-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-14.proof.10"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.14","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.14/","sourceLabel":"I. 4"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-13-14:euclid-3-31:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-14.proof.11"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-31","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.14","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.14/","sourceLabel":"III. 31"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-13-18:euclid-13-14:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-18","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-18.proof.12"],"targetContentId":"euclid-13-14","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.18","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.18/","sourceLabel":"XIII. 14"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-14:euclid-11-12:explicit","id":"euclid-11-12","book":11,"number":12,"kind":"proposition","title":"从平面上一点向平面作垂线","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-14:euclid-1-47:explicit","id":"euclid-1-47","book":1,"number":47,"kind":"proposition","title":"勾股定理：直角三角形斜边平方等于两直角边平方和","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-14:euclid-1-4:explicit","id":"euclid-1-4","book":1,"number":4,"kind":"proposition","title":"三角形全等：两边及其夹角相等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-14:euclid-3-31:explicit","id":"euclid-3-31","book":3,"number":31,"kind":"proposition","title":"半圆所对的圆周角是直角","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-18:euclid-13-14:explicit","id":"euclid-13-18","book":13,"number":18,"kind":"proposition","title":"比较五种正多面体的边长","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-solid","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
